{"speciesId":198,"names":{"fr":"Cornèbre","es":"Murkrow","en":"Murkrow","ja":"ヤミカラス"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"gold","text":"Feared and loathed by many, it is believed to bring misfortune to all those who see it at night."},{"language":"en","version":"silver","text":"It is said that when chased, it lures its attacker onto dark mountain trails where the foe will get lost."},{"language":"en","version":"crystal","text":"It hides any shiny object it finds in a secret location. MURKROW and MEOWTH loot one another's stashes."},{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"MURKROW was feared and loathed as the alleged bearer of ill fortune. This POKéMON shows strong interest in anything that sparkles or glitters. It will even try to steal rings from women."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"MURKROW was feared and loathed as the alleged bearer of ill fortune. This POKéMON shows strong interest in anything that sparkles or glitters. It will even try to steal rings from women."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"MURKROW were feared as the alleged bearers of ill fortune. It shows strong interest in anything that sparkles. It will even try to steal rings from women."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"It is said that when chased, it lures its attacker onto dark mountain trails where the foe will get lost."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"Feared and loathed by many, it is believed to bring misfortune to all those who see it at night."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It is believed that seeing this Pokémon at night will bring about ominous occurrences."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It appears near travelers to lure them into deep forests. It is said to carry misfortune."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"If spotted, it will lure an unwary person into chasing it, then lose the pursuer on mountain trails."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"Feared and loathed by many, it is believed to bring misfortune to all those who see it at night."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"It is said that when chased, it lures its attacker onto dark mountain trails where the foe will get lost."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Quand il est en danger, il tente de semer ses poursuivants dans les chemins montagneux."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"If spotted, it will lure an unwary person into chasing it, then lose the pursuer on mountain trails."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Quand il est en danger, il tente de semer ses poursuivants dans les chemins montagneux."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"If spotted, it will lure an unwary person into chasing it, then lose the pursuer on mountain trails."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"If spotted, it will lure an unwary person into chasing it then lose the pursuer on mountain trails."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"If spotted, it will lure an unwary person into chasing it then lose the pursuer on mountain trails."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il vole tous les objets brillants qu’il voit. Les Cornèbre et les Miaouss se volent mutuellement."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Esconde objetos brillantes en un lugar secreto. Meowth y Murkrow suelen saquear su escondite."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It hides any shiny object it finds in a secret location. Murkrow and Meowth loot one another’s stashes."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"輝く 物を 拾っては 秘密の 場所に 隠しておく。 よく ニャースと 奪い合いになる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Craint et peu aimé, il paraît qu’il porte malheur à ceux qui croisent son chemin la nuit."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Temido y odiado por muchos, dicen que trae la desgracia a todos aquellos que lo ven por la noche."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Feared and loathed by many, it is believed to bring misfortune to all those who see it at night."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"夜 姿を 見かけると 不吉なことが 起きると 信じられ 忌み嫌われている ポケモン。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Jadis, Cornèbre était craint et détesté, car on disait qu’il portait malheur. Ce Pokémon est attiré par tout ce qui brille. Parfois, il essaie de voler les bagues des filles."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Murkrow ha sido temido y repudiado por todos por ser supuestamente fuente de mala suerte. Este Pokémon siente debilidad por todo lo que brilla y resplandece. A las mujeres les roba los anillos."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Murkrow was feared and loathed as the alleged bearer of ill fortune. This Pokémon shows strong interest in anything that sparkles or glitters. It will even try to steal rings from women."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"不幸を 運ぶと いわれ 恐れられていた。 キラキラ 光る ものに 興味を 示し 女性の 指輪を 取っていこうとする。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Jadis, Cornèbre était craint et détesté, car on disait qu’il portait malheur. Ce Pokémon est attiré par tout ce qui brille. Parfois, il essaie de voler les bagues des filles."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Murkrow ha sido temido y repudiado por todos por ser supuestamente fuente de mala suerte. Este Pokémon siente debilidad por todo lo que brilla y resplandece. A las mujeres les roba los anillos."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Murkrow was feared and loathed as the alleged bearer of ill fortune. This Pokémon shows strong interest in anything that sparkles or glitters. It will even try to steal rings from women."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"不幸を 運ぶと いわれ 恐れられていた。 キラキラ 光る ものに 興味を 示し 女性の 指輪を 取っていこうとする。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Il s’éveille au crépuscule et prend son envol à la nuit tombée. Un proverbe local conseille de rentrer chez soi avant l’envol du Cornèbre."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Se despierta al ponerse el sol y vuela toda la noche. Por eso, un viejo refrán aconseja volver a casa antes de que Murkrow levante el vuelo."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"They awaken at dusk and take wing in the twilight, leading to the expression, “Get home before the Murkrow fly.”"},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"日暮れに 目覚め 夕闇を 飛ぶ。 ヤミカラスが 飛ぶまでに 家に 帰れ という ことわざも あるぞ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Les gens voient en lui un oiseau de malheur, mais il offre des choses brillantes aux Dresseurs dont il devient l’ami."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Es odiado por muchos, pues se dice que atrae la desgracia. Si se lleva bien con su Entrenador, lo obsequiará con objetos brillantes."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"Seen as a symbol of bad luck, it’s generally disliked. Yet it gives presents—objects that sparkle or shine—to Trainers it’s close to."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"不吉の 証と 嫌われるが 仲良しの トレーナーには キラキラ 光るものを プレゼントするよ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Il est fasciné par tout ce qui brille. Son obsession pour les trésors est telle qu’il va jusqu’à fouiller les nids des Carmache."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Le gustan los objetos brillantes. Su fascinación por todo cuanto reluce lo lleva a buscar tesoros incluso en los nidos de Gabite."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"It has a weakness for shiny things. It’s been known to sneak into the nests of Gabite—noted collectors of jewels—in search of treasure."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"光るものに 目が ない。 お宝を 求めて 宝石を ため込む ガバイトの 巣に 忍び込むことも。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Il cherche des objets brillants pour son chef. Sa réputation d’oiseau de mauvais augure lui vaut la haine de nombreuses personnes."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Busca objetos brillantes para su patrón. No cuenta con muchas simpatías, pues la gente lo considera ave de mal agüero."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"It searches for shiny things for its boss. Murkrow’s presence is said to be unlucky, so many people detest it."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"ボスのために キラキラ 光るものを 探している。 不吉な 存在と いわれ 忌み嫌う 人も 多い。"},{"language":"en","version":"legends-arceus","text":"Widely shunned as a bearer of ill fortune. Upon crossing paths with this creature, I've been told one must chant ”Workrum, Workrum—bad luck, don't come” as a protective incantation."}],"varieties":[{"id":198,"moves":[{"name":"gust","learns":[[23,"level-up",5],[24,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",5]]},{"name":"wing-attack","learns":[[3,"egg",0],[4,"egg",0],[5,"egg",0],[6,"egg",0],[7,"egg",0],[8,"level-up",15],[8,"egg",0],[9,"level-up",15],[9,"egg",0],[10,"level-up",15],[10,"egg",0],[11,"level-up",15],[11,"egg",0],[14,"level-up",15],[14,"egg",0],[15,"level-up",15],[15,"egg",0],[16,"level-up",15],[16,"egg",0],[17,"level-up",15],[17,"egg",0],[18,"level-up",15],[18,"egg",0],[23,"level-up",15],[23,"egg",0],[25,"level-up",15]]},{"name":"whirlwind","learns":[[3,"egg",0],[4,"egg",0],[5,"egg",0],[6,"egg",0],[7,"egg",0],[8,"egg",0],[9,"egg",0],[10,"egg",0],[11,"egg",0],[14,"egg",0],[15,"egg",0],[16,"egg",0],[17,"egg",0],[18,"egg",0],[23,"egg",0],[25,"egg",0]]},{"name":"fly","learns":[[3,"machine",0],[4,"machine",0],[5,"machine",0],[6,"machine",0],[7,"machine",0],[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"machine",0],[12,"machine",0],[13,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[23,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"double-edge","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[13,"tutor",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"hyper-beam","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"peck","learns":[[3,"level-up",1],[4,"level-up",1],[5,"level-up",1],[6,"level-up",1],[7,"level-up",1],[8,"level-up",1],[9,"level-up",1],[10,"level-up",1],[11,"level-up",1],[12,"level-up",1],[13,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],